---
import PageLayout from "@/src/layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const keywords = ["ITS JPO", "newsletter", "Flash Edition", "August 2026", "CDA", "AI procurement"];
const description = "ITS JPO NOW - Flash Edition (August 2026). Read updates on the CDA Small-Scale Industry Prototype solicitation and the National Webinar on Demystifying AI Procurement.";
---

<PageLayout title="ITS JPO NOW - Flash Edition (August 2026)" keywords={keywords} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="banner">ITS JPO NOW - Flash Edition</Fragment>

  <main class="container-xl newsletter-container shadow rounded-4 p-4 mt-5">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <img
          src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDOTFHWA/2026/04/13450898/6819164/govdelivery-banners-flash_crop.jpg"
          alt="ITS JPO Now - Flash Edition"
          class="newsletter-banner"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="newsletter-divider">
      <hr />
    </div>

    <article id="cda-small-scale-industry-prototype-solicitation" class="newsletter-article">
      <figure class="newsletter-image">
        <img
          src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDOTFHWA/2026/08/14130569/7048776/vehicle-pedestrian-crossing-v2_crop.jpg"
          alt="vehicle pedestrian crossing"
        />
        <figcaption><strong>Source</strong>: FHWA</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <h2 class="newsletter-article-title text-center">Cooperative Driving Automation (CDA) Small-Scale Industry Prototype Solicitation is LIVE!</h2>

      <div class="newsletter-article-content">
        <p>
          The Cooperative Driving Automation (CDA) Small-Scale Industry Prototype Broad Agency Announcement (BAA) has posted on SAM.gov. Up to $5M (across all awardees and phases) will be available to support CDA prototype development, testing, and deployment. The goal is to accelerate the development and testing of a cooperative driving automation prototype by utilizing connectivity and automation in an automotive OEM-supplied vehicle, testing the capability in partnership with a state or local agency. This opportunity will be open to any U.S.-based eligible entity, regardless of prior participation, with proposals due by September 13, 2026. For more information, visit the link via the button below.
        </p>

        <div class="newsletter-cta-wrapper align-right">
          <a
            href="https://urldefense.us/v3/__https:/links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fsam.gov*2Fworkspace*2Fcontract*2Fopp*2Ffa7c3868d1de4478942fab3856ce243e*2Fview/1/0101019fce3734ef-da8fe595-5cd4-4f6d-985e-b9c5ca9b8352-000000/fus2xoaLjxPKsVNnK4VyJiS0p3NoJeVSoRXy5saBxaI=452__;JSUlJSUlJQ!!DJ_L93zn18-Ojg!mggy-Dn7ntq7VSe8hTKwmypFxu3qBlqIzImvsgZofe3pNt6tGQOFsz7PheuW4siJzz4c9Qs1k8986XNl8JSUD2K-UA$"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="newsletter-cta"
          >
            <strong>CDA Small-Scale Industry Prototype BAA Info</strong>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="newsletter-divider">
      <hr />
    </div>

    <article id="national-webinar-demystifying-ai-procurement" class="newsletter-article">
      <figure class="newsletter-image">
        <img
          src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDOTFHWA/2026/08/14130576/7048777/jpo-national-ai-procurement-webinar-image_crop.jpg"
          alt="AI Procurement Webinar"
        />
        <figcaption><strong>Source</strong>: iStock/WANAN YOSSINGKUM</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <h2 class="newsletter-article-title text-center">National Webinar: Demystifying AI Procurement</h2>

      <div class="newsletter-article-content">
        <p>
          As artificial intelligence becomes increasingly central to transportation, multimodal public sector agencies face unique and rapidly evolving challenges in technology acquisition. Attend this AI Procurement National Webinar on September 17, 2026, 1 to 4PM ET, to build a common understanding on issues, identify effective practices and approaches, and establish a shared language around AI procurement themes. This event is open to public sector leadership, management, and technical specialists across all types of multimodal agencies. To find additional AI procurement resources and to register now, visit the link by clicking the button below.
        </p>

        <div class="newsletter-cta-wrapper align-right">
          <a
            href="https://urldefense.us/v3/__https:/links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fitsa-org.zoom.us*2Fwebinar*2Fregister*2FWN_RUS21Y4XTq-hG_5_JPYGBA*23*2Fregistration/1/0101019fce3734ef-da8fe595-5cd4-4f6d-985e-b9c5ca9b8352-000000/ebjxzPO-t0MhdNKPfYPlToW_MZ5hXNE1JK17LgJs248=452__;JSUlJSUlJQ!!DJ_L93zn18-Ojg!mggy-Dn7ntq7VSe8hTKwmypFxu3qBlqIzImvsgZofe3pNt6tGQOFsz7PheuW4siJzz4c9Qs1k8986XNl8JSjKx8Avw$"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="newsletter-cta"
          >
            <strong>Register Now</strong>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="newsletter-divider">
      <hr />
    </div>
    <h1 class="newsletter-section-title underline">STAY CONNECTED</h1>
    <div class="newsletter-section-content">
      <div class="row text-center stay-connected">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
          <h2 class="stay-connected-link">
            <a
              href="https://urldefense.us/v3/__https:/links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fwww.its.dot.gov*2Fabout*2Fcontact-us*2F/1/0101019fce3734ef-da8fe595-5cd4-4f6d-985e-b9c5ca9b8352-000000/aK6-SwqRVTDGT2XvnaaI3eGY4H1oz3YH05JdjrfscLw=452__;JSUlJSU!!DJ_L93zn18-Ojg!mggy-Dn7ntq7VSe8hTKwmypFxu3qBlqIzImvsgZofe3pNt6tGQOFsz7PheuW4siJzz4c9Qs1k8986XNl8JTxfkFBfQ$"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Contact Us
            </a>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
          <h2 class="stay-connected-link">
            <a
              href="https://urldefense.us/v3/__https:/links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fwww.its.dot.gov*2F/1/0101019fce3734ef-da8fe595-5cd4-4f6d-985e-b9c5ca9b8352-000000/kB8fnWZl6CUROKXwMOV0f7nn3CtvZ4RxqjbtROy9GEI=452__;JSUl!!DJ_L93zn18-Ojg!mggy-Dn7ntq7VSe8hTKwmypFxu3qBlqIzImvsgZofe3pNt6tGQOFsz7PheuW4siJzz4c9Qs1k8986XNl8JReVmvLDg$"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Visit our Webpage
            </a>
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <img
          src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDOTFHWA/2026/02/13220765/6730572/govdelivery-newletter-template-25anniversary-footer_crop.jpg"
          alt="ITS JPO footer"
          class="newsletter-footer"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  h4,
  h5,
  h6 {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .newsletter-container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .newsletter-divider {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 15px 0;
  }

  .newsletter-divider hr {
    border: none;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #ddd;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .newsletter-section-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #1e3769;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .newsletter-section-title.underline {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .newsletter-section-content {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .newsletter-article {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .newsletter-image {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .newsletter-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .newsletter-image figcaption {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #666;
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: "Tahoma", sans-serif;
  }

  .newsletter-article-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #1e3769;
    font-family: "Tahoma", sans-serif;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .newsletter-article-content {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-family: "Tahoma", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
  }

  .newsletter-article-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .newsletter-article-content a {
    color: #167796;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .newsletter-article-content ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .newsletter-article-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter-cta-wrapper {
    padding: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .newsletter-cta-wrapper.align-left {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .newsletter-cta-wrapper.align-right {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .newsletter-cta-wrapper.align-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #0c77cf;
    color: white !important;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }

  .newsletter-cta:hover {
    background-color: #095a9c;
    color: white !important;
  }

  .newsletter-cta strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .newsletter-banner,
  .newsletter-footer {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .newsletter-footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .stay-connected {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .stay-connected-link {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .stay-connected-link a {
    color: #1d5782;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .stay-connected-link a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .newsletter-container {
      padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
